Carried files

Each entry below names a file in this repository and the file of stfc/goldilocks-agent it was
carried from, at commit ea757c7. An entry is one line, indented or not, written like the text
after "Format:" here:
Format: - <path in this repository> <- <path in stfc/goldilocks-agent>@ea757c7
A carried file in a format that has comments also starts with a comment line that contains
"Carried from stfc/goldilocks-agent", its source path and ea757c7. A file in a format without
comments, such as JSON, is recorded here only. tools/checks/notice.sh checks both directions.

